 Supports cursor pagination and filters such as `search_query` and
 `include_archived`.
 
+`updated_after` (Unix epoch seconds) lists only sessions whose `updated_at` is
+later than that time; combine it with `sort_by=updated_at` to read the most
+recently active sessions first.
+
